],"description":"<ul><li><strong>36 Fully Furnished Villas:</strong> Each villa is impeccably furnished, offering a turnkey luxury living experience with bespoke interiors by Bentley Home.</li><li><strong>Prime Location in D11 District, Meydan:</strong> Situated in the prestigious District 11, Meydan, Dubai, providing excellent connectivity and a central location.</li><li><strong>Bespoke Gym:</strong> State-of-the-art gym facilities tailored to meet all your fitness needs, featuring the latest equipment and personalized fitness programs.</li><li><strong>Exclusive Club House with F&amp;B Services:</strong> A luxurious clubhouse featuring top-notch food and beverage services for residents to socialize and unwind in style.</li><li><strong>Panoramic Dubai Skyline Views:</strong> Breathtaking views of the iconic Dubai skyline from the comfort of your villa.</li><li><strong>Serene Waterfront Living:</strong> Experience the perfect balance of urban convenience and natural beauty with private lagoon access.</li><li><strong>Luxury Living Bentley Villas Dubai:</strong> Renowned for exceptional design and superior craftsmanship, ensuring each villa is a masterpiece.</li><li><strong>Unparalleled Attention to Detail:</strong> Every element of the villas showcases meticulous attention to detail, providing an exceptional living experience.</li><li><strong>Opulent Amenities:</strong> Access to a range of high-end amenities, including a bespoke gym, crystal lagoon, and exclusive clubhouse.<br><strong>Investment Potential:</strong> The prestigious location and luxurious features make these villas a prime investment opportunity.</li><li><strong>Privacy and Security:</strong> The community offers a secure and private environment, ensuring peace of mind for residents.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":982,"cta":{"id":1621,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":null,"isExternal":false,"custom_link":null},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws